{"version":1,"content":"<p>視帝羅嘉良（撈家）今日（15日）現身電視城，為台慶的開場歌舞進行綵排，他透露對上一次出席台慶已是23年前的事，今次應監製邀請聯同一眾年輕藝員演繹其經典劇集《難兄難弟》主題曲《難兄難弟》及插曲《奇哥》，他坦言勾起無數回憶，更指該劇是他演藝生涯</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T07:37:08.423172+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T07:01:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T07:30:54.197146+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T07:30:54.197146+00:00","content_hash":"efa57c4295a0eedf187aa27aee4ceffe0a47fb6604b9305b0210c542b686d0bb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}